@baseUrl = http://localhost:8081
@keyword = 周杰伦
@showId = 1

### 1. 搜索演出
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/search/shows?keyword={{keyword}}&limit=20

### 2. 访问演出详情
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/shows/{{showId}}

### 3. 最近 24 小时热榜
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/rankings/artists?period=hot&limit=20

### 4. 今日榜
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/rankings/artists?period=daily&limit=20

### 5. 本周榜
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/rankings/artists?period=weekly&limit=20

### 6. 本月榜
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/rankings/artists?period=monthly&limit=20

### 7. 累计榜
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/rankings/artists?period=all&limit=20
